`the decision's agora annexes` MEANS
    LIST `annex א1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`, `annex א2 of the decision of 14.1.2025`,
         `annex ב1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`, `annex ב2 of the decision of 14.1.2025`,
         `annex ג1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`, `annex ג2 of the decision of 14.1.2025`

-- What the agora tables are to the agreement's: each is, cell for cell, the
-- whole grades of the agreement's own conversion table of the same degree
-- (א3, א4; ב3, ב4; ג3, ג4), which the signed copy prints to the agora; and
-- each, rounded, is the shekel table it replaces, within half a shekel. So
-- the agorot "left out by oversight" are the conversion tables'.
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex א1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex א3 of the signed copy`) `at` 1 `within` 0
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex א2 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex א4 of the signed copy`) `at` 1 `within` 0
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ב1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ב3 of the signed copy`) `at` 1 `within` 0
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ב2 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ב4 of the signed copy`) `at` 1 `within` 0
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ג1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ג3 of the signed copy`) `at` 1 `within` 0
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ג2 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ג4 of the signed copy`) `at` 1 `within` 0
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex א1 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex א1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `at` 1 `within` 0.5
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex א2 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex א2 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `at` 1 `within` 0.5
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ב1 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ב1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `at` 1 `within` 0.5
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ב2 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ב2 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `at` 1 `within` 0.5
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ג1 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ג1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `at` 1 `within` 0.5
#ASSERT `every cell of` (`the first table of` `annex ג2 of the signed copy`) `agrees with` (`the first table of` `annex ג2 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `at` 1 `within` 0.5
-- The same cells, the same shape: 36 seniority rows in א1 and א2.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD count ((`the first table of` a)'s `signed-copy grid rows`) EQUALS 36) (LIST `annex א1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`, `annex א2 of the decision of 14.1.2025`)
#ASSERT map (GIVEN a YIELD a's `signed-copy annex printed day`) `the decision's agora annexes` EQUALS map (GIVEN a YIELD a's `signed-copy annex printed day`) (LIST `annex א1 of the signed copy`, `annex א2 of the signed copy`, `annex ב1 of the signed copy`, `annex ב2 of the signed copy`, `annex ג1 of the signed copy`, `annex ג2 of the signed copy`)
